{"step_index":1421,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T08:14:56Z","content":"Here is the **exact, real-time hop-by-hop route** traced directly from your Debian Trixie workstation to the destination in the TH2 datacenter:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Live Layer-3 Traceroute (TCP SYN Probe)\n\n```text\ntraceroute to 172.30.198.33, 30 hops max:\n 1  10.6.201.252   1.08 ms   [Local Check Point Firewall Gateway]\n 2  10.6.10.248    1.10 ms   [Site Core / Distribution Router]\n ----------------------------- WAN Submarine Link (+208 ms) -----------------------------\n 3  172.17.17.228  209.14 ms  [Inter-site Transport / WAN Tunnel Gateway]\n 4  172.17.17.227  221.00 ms  [TH2 Datacenter Perimeter Router / Firewall]\n 5  172.30.198.33  209.10 ms  [th2-revproxyp-fe1 (Reverse Proxy)]\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Network Topology & Hop Breakdown\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Workstation[\"Your Debian Trixie\\n10.6.201.54 / 24\\n(Interface enp0s31f6)\"]\n    \n    subgraph Local_Office [\"🏢 Local Office LAN (< 1.5 ms)\"]\n        Hop1[\"Hop 1: 10.6.201.254 (node .252)\\nCheck Point ClusterXL Firewall Gateway\\nMAC: 00:1c:7f:c6:f5:ef\"]\n        Hop2[\"Hop 2: 10.6.10.248\\nOffice Core / Distribution Switch\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph WAN_Link [\"🌊 Transatlantic / Submarine Fiber (~208 ms latency jump)\"]\n        Hop3[\"Hop 3: 172.17.17.228\\nWAN Inter-site Router / IPsec Gateway\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph TH2_Datacenter [\"🏭 Paris TH2 Datacenter (~210 ms)\"]\n        Hop4[\"Hop 4: 172.17.17.227\\nDatacenter Edge Router / Firewall Transit\"]\n        Hop5[\"Hop 5: 172.30.198.33\\nth2-revproxyp-fe1 (Nginx DMZ)\"]\n    end\n\n    Workstation -->|Default Gateway| Hop1\n    Hop1 --> Hop2\n    Hop2 --> Hop3\n    Hop3 --> Hop4\n    Hop4 --> Hop5\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Detailed Hop Analysis\n\n1. **Hop 1 — `10.6.201.254` (Active Node: `10.6.201.252`)**:\n   * **Role:** Your local subnet default gateway.\n   * **Device:** A **Check Point Firewall cluster**